      "natural_statement": "For all real H,d,w>0 with d^2 H>=6 and dw<1/3, put W=dH, R=H/w, T=d^2H, a0=WT/(1+T). There exist integers i,p,q and real a,b,t such that i*q-3*p=1, a0<a<W, b=W-a>0, t=a/b>T, a=Wt/(1+t), b=W/(1+t), -3a<3b<i/d, and i/d+3a=R.",
